  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Immortal Succession Mountain is a tall, lone mountain, not a famous mountain or river. It has ten levels, getting smaller towards the top, with evident signs of man-made design. Around the mountain are forests with lots of resources. Near the peak sits a single stone pavilion of simple structure but grand atmosphere, supported by eight thick pillars. A huge elephant-sized stone tablet fills almost all the space inside.",
      "chapters": [
        1121
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In Mini Southern Border it has many stone pavilions and good scenery.",
      "chapters": [
        1159
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_mini_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mortals go up Immortal Succession Mountain and inherit methods left in inheritances there. Feng Jun is named as the only person who ascended it and became a Gu Immortal among the grotto-heaven’s immortals speaking to Fang Yuan.",
      "chapters": [
        1126
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jun",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan inspects it, most stone pavilions are already empty, with only a few inheritances left, and he keeps all of them, ransacking the mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        1132
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once Five Light Mountain is added to Mini Southern Border, Immortal Succession Mountain becomes only the second tallest mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        1152
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
